{
 "once": false,
 "_doc": "ITRMapLoader's trigger Blueprint: logic only, no mesh, no collision, no component the player can meet, no Tick, no timer. One per trigger of a form. It finds the author's object in the stream it names and binds it (collision: overlap events of every part, only the player body fires, once per entry; grab: the object's own OnGripped, no delay). Fire: a way in calls Entry.Enter(); an exit stores the return point, then enters another map (Dest), or transfers to a stock level (ToTag, AtGate or a saved position), or to the Hub. It changes nothing on the author's object.",
